# Risk Assessment

> ISO 27001:2022 §6.1.2 — Information security risk assessment

_Generated by arbiter at L3 governance level. Review and update annually or after significant architecture changes._

## Probability × Impact Matrix (P×I)

| Probability \ Impact | Low (1) | Medium (2) | High (3) | Critical (4) |
|----------------------|---------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| **Unlikely (1)**     | 1       | 2         | 3       | 4           |
| **Possible (2)**     | 2       | 4         | 6       | 8           |
| **Likely (3)**       | 3       | 6         | 9       | 12          |
| **Almost Certain (4)**| 4      | 8         | 12      | 16          |

### Risk Thresholds

| Score | Tier       | Action Required                                  |
|-------|------------|--------------------------------------------------|
| ≤ 4   | Low        | Monitor; no immediate action required            |
| 5–8   | Medium     | Mitigate within 90 days; document in backlog     |
| 9–12  | High       | Mitigate within 30 days; notify security team    |
| > 12  | Critical   | Immediate mitigation; escalate to management     |

